        "payload": "tree 1912d1cbcea2306ea2c3bb69f00dd86be42a1624\nparent bcd18d289845051b0f0513e11bc1aefd3f766902\nauthor Cassie_Fox <249835913+CassieFox23@users.noreply.github.com> 1792792282 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792792282 +0800\n\ndocs(readme): show a dark showcase image on dark themes (#6915)\n\nThe showcase illustration was a single light PNG, so it stayed a white\nslab on GitHub's dark themes. Redraw it as a light and a dark SVG, and\nswap the linked image in README.md and all 21 translations for a\n<picture> with a prefers-color-scheme: dark source. Alt text and link\ntargets are unchanged. The PNG is deleted because nothing else uses it.\nwebsite/figures.md notes the pair.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (Sonnet 5.5) 🦊\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
