      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-23T11:03:03Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(runtime): align remaining Node security pins and setup guidance (#6316)\n\nDerive exported Docker image versions from .nvmrc through generated package metadata. Align active setup translations with patched Node release floors and verify actual CLI exports, real Docker/agentenv, package and website workflows.\n\nEight built-test shards pass; three unrelated managed source failures reproduce on clean main and remain tracked in #6650.\n\nRefs #6480\n\nCo-authored-by: gensokyo-dev <342580529+gensokyo-dev@users.noreply.github.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "4f66bd793d984b93d108c715046dd316b82d9203",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/morluto/rea/git/trees/4f66bd793d984b93d108c715046dd316b82d9203"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/morluto/rea/git/commits/520f8e8042c39833fb1656d3e55fb2896bff43a5",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
