        "payload": "tree 4f66bd793d984b93d108c715046dd316b82d9203\nparent 19520d00087bc92b5c1020918ea3b7c064768bb4\nauthor GamerDubz <105694977+GamerDubz@users.noreply.github.com> 1792753383 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792753383 +0000\n\nfix(runtime): align remaining Node security pins and setup guidance (#6316)\n\nDerive exported Docker image versions from .nvmrc through generated package metadata. Align active setup translations with patched Node release floors and verify actual CLI exports, real Docker/agentenv, package and website workflows.\n\nEight built-test shards pass; three unrelated managed source failures reproduce on clean main and remain tracked in #6650.\n\nRefs #6480\n\nCo-authored-by: gensokyo-dev <342580529+gensokyo-dev@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-23T11:03:04Z"
