      "message": "docs(readme): add Roman Urdu edition (#6499)\n\n* docs(readme): add Roman Urdu edition\n\nRegister ur-Latn with a pending website catalog and preserve English command examples.\n\nScript-tag handling follows morluto's shared helper proposed in PR #2043 (c46f606c899e27b2e51c16500493413daf57ddad).\n\n* test(website): cover completed script-tag page metadata",
